{"product_id":"amy-on-park-patrol-17-the-critter-club","title":"Amy on Park Patrol (17) (The Critter Club)","description":"\u003cp\u003eAmy must come up with a plan to save a park—and all the animals living there—in the seventeenth book of the Critter Club series.When Amy learns that part of a nearby park may be destroyed and replaced by a shopping center, she’s devastated. Amy has spent her whole life visiting and playing in that park, and she’s always loved going on nature walks there. She can’t stand the idea that the park—and all the animals in it—would disappear! Can Amy come up with a plan to save the park?With easy-to-read language and illustrations on almost every page, The Critter Club chapter books are perfect for beginning readers!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 140 x 186\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Callie Barkley\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781481494328\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 128\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45871444394137,"sku":"12RC9781481494328","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/690f05201955a_Amy_on_Park_Patrol__17___The_Critter_Club.jpg?v=1762599699","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/amy-on-park-patrol-17-the-critter-club","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}